---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalTabs from '../../components/legal/LegalTabs.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use | NutritionColours"
  description="Review the terms, educational limits, safety boundaries, and acceptable use rules for the NutritionColours website."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Policies', path: '/legal/editorial-policy' },
    { name: 'Terms of use', path: '/legal/terms' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline">Home</a></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Policies</span></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200">Terms of use</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- Legal Sub-Navigation Tabs -->
    <LegalTabs current="/legal/terms" />

    <div class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-800 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">
      <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Website Terms & Conditions
    </div>

    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-50 brand-font tracking-tight">
      Terms of website use
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
      Last updated: <time datetime="2026-08-20">20 August 2026</time> &middot; Release Baseline: v2.4
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-5">
      Please review the terms, educational boundaries, and acceptable use conditions that govern your access to the NutritionColours platform.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10">
      <!-- Section 1: Educational Scope Only -->
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-7 md:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100 brand-font">Educational scope only & no clinical relationship</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
          The articles, guides, databases, and software tools provided on this website are for educational and informational purposes only. Accessing this website does not establish a clinician&ndash;patient relationship, telemedicine contract, or therapeutic engagement. The content must never be used to diagnose acute conditions, prescribe therapeutic dosages, alter prescribed medication regimens, or substitute for in-person evaluation by a qualified medical specialist.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: No Guaranteed Outcomes -->
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/60 bg-amber-50/70 dark:bg-amber-950/30 p-7 md:p-8 text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-100 brand-font">No guaranteed biological outcomes</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
          Metabolic responses, microbiome signaling, and nutritional requirements vary extensively between individuals based on genetics, lifestyle, and underlying pathology. NutritionColours strictly rejects all guaranteed cure or reversal claims. No page, recipe, or planned educational module guarantees any specific outcome.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Draft Limitations -->
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-7 md:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100 brand-font">Draft status & verification limits</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
          Certain legacy topics remain in non-indexed editorial review. A publication date, citation link, or technical taxonomy label does not by itself constitute independent clinical certification. Users are urged to verify assertions against primary literature and consult licensed physicians for personal care decisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Acceptable Use -->
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-7 md:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100 brand-font">Acceptable website use</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
          You agree not to misuse this website, attempt unauthorized penetration testing, bypass security headers, interfere with availability through automated scrapers or flood requests, or transmit confidential medical records through general administrative contact forms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Contact -->
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-stone-50/70 dark:bg-stone-800/50 p-7 md:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100 brand-font">Questions & legal inquiries</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
          Questions regarding these website terms, intellectual property, or editorial governance can be addressed to our administrative desk:
        </p>
        <div>
          <a
            href="mailto:info@nutritioncolours.com?subject=Terms%20Inquiry"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-900 dark:bg-emerald-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-emerald-800 dark:hover:bg-emerald-800 transition-colors"
          >
            info@nutritioncolours.com &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
